{"id": "DfAdjf6ARg9", "title": "Video by capyember", "description": "If your game has fire, poison and bleed, and the only difference is how hard they hit, players will pick the strongest one and the other two are dead weight.\n\nThe difference shouldn't be the number. It should be what each one does:\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Fire spreads: when an enemy dies burning, it lights up the three closest ones.\n\u2620\ufe0f Poison weakens: every ten stacks, the enemy takes 10% more damage from anything.\n\ud83e\ude78 Bleed bursts: at five stacks, it deals all its remaining damage at once.\n\nNow each one has a job: fire for hordes, poison for long fights and bleed for taking down one target, fast.\n\nCapy of Gods: free demo on Steam, link in bio. Out November 9.\n\n#CapyOfGods #gamedev #indiegame #godot #pixelart #roguelike #devlog #gamedesign #Steam", "channel": "capyember", "uploader_id": "37003530640", "uploader": "Francisco Alvial", "timestamp": 1793124484, "like_count": 1693, "comment_count": 34, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18106786709234641a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 82.494, "asr": 96000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNBDyeH_i0Y5q07D1ydn-nbysuQZOQtbl6nCTngrg_0N2_27dc0wYyWJDwvn_oQY1nazoLUaUX1cRw2XyL2joC-hD6bPTgRaxoQQZk.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=ZcFFBGbxMdMQ7kNvwF7k4Mh&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=3qtxBYpS7ZBgWABZJSvp9Q&_nc_ss=79689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSg