ited if not kept up", "timestamp": 1793183936, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "endsssssssssss", "author_id": "76492538486", "id": "17999662802822682", "text": "How to make sprites sheets someone for god sakes bring tutorial", "timestamp": 1793178244, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "poopidypappidi", "author_id": "9905657104", "id": "17968476336228805", "text": "Your videos are so underrated \ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25", "timestamp": 1793173839, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "dan__b.o_o.d", "author_id": "67542747024", "id": "18353134441268655", "text": "Could also make poison give a slowing effect if they move", "timestamp": 1793170892, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "unalutku", "author_id": "66286592297", "id": "18430807087146776", "text": "i think bleed should get stronger with time so its good for bosses, while poison should slow down enemy movement or reduce their damage so its good for things that hunt you, and fire should just be generally the normal \"damage over time\" attack but with a chance of spreading to close enemies so its good for crowd management", "timestamp": 1793169036, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "amu_gr_", "author_id": "5828472833", "id": "18158096971515094", "text": "*enters boss fight\u2026.. uses all 3 procs* \ud83d\ude2d\ud83d\ude02", "timestamp": 1793152592, "like_count": 15}, {"author": "isaac.csharp", "author_id": "39090739712", "id": "17915263338541991", "text": "Fire spreading, poison weakening, and bleed bursting is such a clean mechanical distinction for status effects", "timestamp": 1793139603, "like_count": 59}, {"author": "marteno938", "author_id": "73705757566", "id": "17952911145313105", "text": "Cann't you at resitenz and weakneases Like in dnd to", "timestamp": 1793136811, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "final.wars4", "author_id": "68425903927", "id": "18397569361167549", "text": "I love your videos!!! They are so inspiring! \ud83d\udc4f\ud83d\udc4f\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25", "timestamp": 1793136212, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "spyrosgobrrrrrrrr", "author_id": "35389230003", "id": "18133665349664247", "text": "May I kindly steal your ideas", "timestamp": 1793133507, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "intren123", "author_id": "27916337495", "id": "18132979564741594", "text": "Ive got the bleed build in my sights", "timestamp": 1793132450, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "battlebottactics", "author_id": "36652727025", "id": "17914563567287595", "text": "does the fire chain need a gap between kills, or can a whole horde light up in one go?", "timestamp": 1793131818, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "lochastlugh", "author_id": "80073192977", "id": "18114361397073527", "text": "It seems you put lord of effort into this I\u2019m adding it to my saved indi video games I\u2019ll play when I get a pc", "timestamp": 1793127338, "like_count": 37}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfAdjf6ARg9/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfAdjf6ARg9/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfAdjf6ARg9", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/868000632_1471471932705168_6722035100847820589_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ig_cache_key=NDAxNzM0MDg1MDQwNDEzNzAyMTE4MTA2Nzg2ODUwMjM0NjQx.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=O7EyQPOTaBYQ7kNvwHfn3RA&_nc_oc=Adp8w2vXYrtcRTPDG3916KIVY3tdWtmKrPiNblv6p_xHLzzCHGXC0Jd_0zIeWs6V5uU&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=3qtxBYpS7ZBgWABZJSvp9Q&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQQWYvEjm6wroJASnJ17drsjooTBlg7TF2XMqC6Kr6Kb-g&oe=6AE8A38C", "display_id": "DfAdjf6ARg9", "fulltitle": "Video by capyember", "upload_date": "20261027", "release_year": null, "requested_subtitles": null, "_has_drm": null, "epoch": 1793243118, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNpJxvka4X4Y6oWwD97aXBJTu49